A||||3||88QuadPagasus||T-Top sub controls?||||1||
Z||000000||88QuadPagasus||12-21-2001||04:31 AM||||I've just bought a sub with controls, but the controls are for the fieros without t-tops.  Has anyone bought a stock sub, and installed it in a car that has t-tops, or where do I find a t-top control with sub control.  Also has anyone rigged the sub with custom dial of some sort?<BR>Thanks!<P>Cesar<P>------------------<BR>88 Quad 4<BR>98 CamaroSS Convt(for sale)<BR>70 CamaroRS (under resto)||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfixit58||12-21-2001||08:27 AM||||88Qaud,<P>I'm not exactly sure what your asking. But, if you asking about installing a sub-woofer slider switch in a t-top overhead console, then I can help. My 88 t-top has the slider switch installed from the factory (actually C&C but it was ordered from the factory). It simply just mounts like the non t-top car. The biggest difference is the slider switch sits deeper then original because the t-top cover is thicker.<P>If you want to do something custom, I believe all the slider switch is, is a 10k ohm variable resister that is available at Radio Shack.<P>Hope this helps,<P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <P><B>JUST ADDED: </B>1988 GT w/ T-Tops, 5-Speed, and Performance Sound.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phil||12-21-2001||08:33 AM||||The slider is a 10K resistor BUT there is also a 10K-20K  variable resistance from one of the slider switch wires going to ground. Without this grounding the sub is on full max all the time(ask me how I know this). Actually very easy to rig up a dial that can be mounted at any handy location||||reg||1
Z||000003||skitime||12-21-2001||09:36 AM||||The t-top slider cover fits over the stock cover after the corners are cut off.  The cover has two 1 1/2 radius curves at the corners.  Here is a link to a pic of it. <A HREF="http://fierottop.com/archive/ttoppic11.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fierottop.com/archive/ttoppic11.html</A> <BR>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-2.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||1
